T1  - Pharmacometric evaluation of sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine- amodiaquine and dihydroartemisinin-piperaquine seasonal malaria chemoprevention in northern Uganda.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/cid/ciaf615
A1  - Bonnington, Craig
