T1  - Low Complexity of Infection Is Associated With Molecular Persistence of Plasmodium falciparum in Kenya and Tanzania.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fepid.2022.852237
A1  - Topazian, Hillary M
A1  - Moser, Kara A
A1  - Ngasala, Billy
A1  - Oluoch, Peter O
A1  - Forconi, Catherine S
A1  - Mhamilawa, Lwidiko E
A1  - Aydemir, Ozkan
