T1  - Emergence and Rising Prevalence of Artemisinin Partial Resistance Marker Kelch13 P441L in a Low Malaria Transmission Setting in Southern Zambia.
T3  - Update of: medRxiv. 2025 Jan 02:2025.01.02.24319706. doi: 10.1101/2025.01.02.24319706. PMID: 39802768 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39802768]
