T1  - Toward Setting Minimum and Optimal Data to Report for Malaria Molecular Surveillance with Targeted Sequencing: The "What" and "Why".
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.4269/ajtmh.25-0147
A1  - Juliano, Jonathan J
A1  - Meier-Scherling, Cecile P G
