T1  - A novel intron variant is associated with emerging pfdhps mutant haplotypes in West and Central African Plasmodium falciparum.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ijpddr.2025.100611
A1  - Hocke, Emma Filtenborg
A1  - Hansson, Helle
