T1  - Parasite clearance and protection from Plasmodium falciparum infection (PCPI): a two-arm, parallel, double-blinded, placebo-controlled, randomised trial of presumptive sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine versus artesunate monotherapy among asymptomatic children 3-5 years of age in Zambia.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12879-025-11975-3
A1  - Martinez-Vega, Rosario
A1  - Chaponda, Mike
A1  - Mousa, Andria
A1  - Gwasupika, Jonathan
A1  - Chaponda, Enesia Banda
