T1  - Changes in susceptibility of Plasmodium falciparum to antimalarial drugs in Uganda over time: 2019-2024.
T3  - Update of: medRxiv. 2025 Jan 01:2024.12.31.24319821. doi: 10.1101/2024.12.31.24319821. PMID: 39802777 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39802777]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-62810-x
A1  - Okitwi, Martin
A1  - Orena, Stephen
A1  - Tumwebaze, Patrick K
A1  - Katairo, Thomas
