T1  - Plasmodium falciparum multidrug resistance 1 gene polymorphisms associated with outcomes after anti-malarial treatment.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12936-025-05248-2
A1  - Laird, Veronika R
A1  - Plucinski, Mateusz M
A1  - Venkatesan, Meera
