T1  - Impact of dhps mutations on sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine protective efficacy and implications for malaria chemoprevention.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-58326-z
A1  - Mousa, Andria
A1  - Cuomo-Dannenburg, Gina
A1  - Thompson, Hayley A
