T1  - Prevalence of mutations associated with artemisinin partial resistance and sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine resistance in 13 regions in Tanzania in 2021: a cross-sectional survey.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S2666-5247(24)00160-5
A1  - Juliano, Jonathan J
A1  - Giesbrecht, David J
A1  - Simkin, Alfred
A1  - Fola, Abebe A
A1  - Lyimo, Beatus M
A1  - Pereus, Dativa
