T1  - Genome sequencing of Plasmodium malariae identifies continental segregation and mutations associated with reduced pyrimethamine susceptibility.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-55102-3
A1  - Ibrahim, Amy
A1  - Mohring, Franziska
A1  - Manko, Emilia
A1  - van Schalkwyk, Donelly A
A1  - Phelan, Jody E
A1  - Nolder, Debbie
