T1  - Parasite clearance and protection from Plasmodium falciparum infection (PCPI): a three-arm, parallel, double-blinded, placebo-controlled, randomised trial of presumptive sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine versus sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine plus amodiaquine versus artesunate monotherapy among asymptomatic children 3-5 years of age in Cameroon.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12879-024-09868-y
A1  - Martinez-Vega, Rosario
A1  - Mbacham, Wilfred Fon
A1  - Ali, Innocent
A1  - Nji, Akindeh
A1  - Mousa, Andria
A1  - Beshir, Khalid B
