T1  - Ex vivo susceptibilities to ganaplacide and diversity in potential resistance mediators in Ugandan Plasmodium falciparum isolates.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1128/aac.00466-24
A1  - Kreutzfeld, Oriana
A1  - Orena, Stephen
