T1  - Rapid and supersensitive allele detection of Plasmodium falciparum chloroquine resistance via a Pyrococcus furiosus argonaute-triggered dual-signal biosensing platform.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s13071-024-06575-0
A1  - Chen, Liying
A1  - Chen, Wencheng
A1  - Wei, Huagui
A1  - Lin, Wenai
A1  - Zhang, Cheng
