T1  - Expansion of artemisinin partial resistance mutations and lack of histidine rich protein-2 and -3 deletions in Plasmodium falciparum infections from Rukara, Rwanda.
T3  - Update of: medRxiv. 2023 Dec 18:2023.12.17.23300081. doi: 10.1101/2023.12.17.23300081 PMID: 38196592 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38196592]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12936-024-04981-4
A1  - Schreidah, Cecile
A1  - Giesbrecht, David
A1  - Gashema, Pierre
A1  - Young, Neeva Wernsman
A1  - Munyaneza, Tharcisse
A1  - Muvunyi, Claude Mambo
