T1  - Sustained clinical benefit of malaria chemoprevention with sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine (SP) in pregnant women in a region with high SP resistance markers.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jinf.2024.106144
A1  - Matambisso, Gloria
