T1  - Detection of Artemisinin Resistance Marker Kelch-13 469Y in Plasmodium falciparum, South Kivu, Democratic Republic of the Congo, 2022.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.4269/ajtmh.23-0740
A1  - van Loon, Welmoed
A1  - Bisimwa, Bertin C
A1  - Byela, Valery
A1  - Kirby, Rebecca
A1  - Bugeme, Patrick M
