T1  - Prevalence of molecular markers of resistance to sulfadoxine-pyrimethamine before and after community delivery of intermittent preventive treatment of malaria in pregnancy in sub-Saharan Africa: a multi-country evaluation.
T3  - Comment in: Lancet Glob Health. 2023 Nov;11(11):e1676-e1677. doi: 10.1016/S2214-109X(23)00435-7 PMID: 37858575 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37858575]
