T1  - Measuring Growth, Resistance, and Recovery after Artemisinin Treatment of Plasmodium falciparum in a single semi-high-throughput Assay.
T3  - Update in: Malar J. 2025 Aug 14;24(1):263. doi: 10.1186/s12936-025-05481-9. PMID: 40814090 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40814090]
