T1  - Changes in susceptibility of Plasmodium falciparum to antimalarial drugs in Uganda over time: 2019-2024.
T3  - Update in: Nat Commun. 2025 Aug 9;16(1):7353. doi: 10.1038/s41467-025-62810-x. PMID: 40783405 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40783405]
