T1  - Highly multiplexed molecular inversion probe panel in Plasmodium falciparum targeting common SNPs approximates whole-genome sequencing assessments for selection and relatedness.
T3  - Update of: medRxiv. 2025 Mar 13:2025.03.07.25323597. doi: 10.1101/2025.03.07.25323597. PMID: 40162260 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40162260]
