T1  - Micro-epidemiological structuring of Plasmodium falciparum parasite populations in regions with varying transmission intensities in Africa.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.12688/wellcomeopenres.10784.2
A1  - Omedo, Irene
A1  - Mogeni, Polycarp
A1  - Bousema, Teun
