T1  - Dynamics of Persistent Submicroscopic and Microscopic Plasmodium falciparum in Pregnant Women Under Intermittent Preventive Treatment: A Study Cohort in Benin.
T3  - Erratum in: Open Forum Infect Dis. 2025 Feb 13;12(2):ofaf071. doi: 10.1093/ofid/ofaf071. PMID: 39949706 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39949706]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ofid/ofae762
A1  - Jafari-Guemouri, Sayeh
A1  - Degbegni, Robinson
A1  - Courtois, Laura
A1  - Accrombessi, Manfred
