T1  - Genomics reveals heterogeneous Plasmodium falciparum transmission and population differentiation in Zambia and bordering countries.
T3  - Update in: Commun Med (Lond). 2024 Apr 6;4(1):67. doi: 10.1038/s43856-024-00498-8 PMID: 38582941 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38582941]
