T1  - Expansion of Artemisinin Partial Resistance Mutations and Lack of Histidine Rich Protein-2 and -3 Deletions in Plasmodium falciparum infections from Rukara, Rwanda.
T3  - Update in: Malar J. 2024 May 16;23(1):150. doi: 10.1186/s12936-024-04981-4 PMID: 38755607 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38755607]
