T1  - Ex vivo RSA and Pfkelch13 targeted-amplicon deep sequencing reveal parasites susceptibility to artemisinin in Senegal, 2017.
T3  - Update in: Malar J. 2023 May 26;22(1):167. doi: 10.1186/s12936-023-04588-1 PMID: 37237307 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37237307]
