T1  - Assessment of the Feasibility, Acceptability, and Impact of Implementing Seasonal Malaria Chemoprevention in Nampula Province, Mozambique: Protocol for a Hybrid Effectiveness-Implementation Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2196/27855
A1  - Wharton-Smith, Alexandra
A1  - Baker, Kevin
A1  - Roca-Feltrer, Arantxa
A1  - Rodrigues, Maria
