T1  - Plasmodium malariae structure and genetic diversity in sub-Saharan Africa determined from microsatellite variants and linked SNPs in orthologues of antimalarial resistance genes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-022-26625-w
A1  - Oriero, Eniyou C
A1  - Demba, Martha A
A1  - Diop, Mouhamadou F
