T1  - Impact of parasite genomic dynamics on the sensitivity of Plasmodium falciparum isolates to piperaquine and other antimalarial drugs.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12916-022-02652-2
A1  - Wakoli, Dancan M
A1  - Ondigo, Bartholomew N
