T1  - In vitro susceptibility profile of Plasmodium falciparum clinical isolates from Ghana to antimalarial drugs and polymorphisms in resistance markers.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fcimb.2022.1015957
A1  - Zhao, Wei
A1  - Li, Xinxin
A1  - Yang, Qi
A1  - Zhou, Longcan
A1  - Duan, Mengxi
A1  - Pan, Maohua
A1  - Qin, Yucheng
A1  - Li, Xiaosong
