T1  - Prospective surveillance study to detect antimalarial drug resistance, gene deletions of diagnostic relevance and genetic diversity of Plasmodium falciparum in Mozambique: protocol.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2022-063456
