T1  - Efficacy of Cipargamin (KAE609) in a Randomized, Phase II Dose-Escalation Study in Adults in Sub-Saharan Africa With Uncomplicated Plasmodium falciparum Malaria.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/cid/ciab716
A1  - Schmitt, Esther K
