T1  - Plasmodium falciparum K13 mutations in Africa and Asia impact artemisinin resistance and parasite fitness.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.7554/eLife.66277
A1  - Stokes, Barbara H
A1  - Dhingra, Satish K
A1  - Rubiano, Kelly
A1  - Mok, Sachel
A1  - Straimer, Judith
