T1  - Describing the current status of Plasmodium falciparum population structure and drug resistance within mainland Tanzania using molecular inversion probes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/mec.15706
A1  - Moser, Kara A
A1  - Madebe, Rashid A
A1  - Aydemir, Ozkan
A1  - Chiduo, Mercy G
A1  - Mandara, Celine I
A1  - Rumisha, Susan F
A1  - Chaky, Frank
A1  - Denton, Madeline
A1  - Marsh, Patrick W
A1  - Verity, Robert
A1  - Watson, Oliver J
A1  - Ngasala, Billy
A1  - Mkude, Sigsbert
A1  - Molteni, Fabrizio
