T1  - Spatial and molecular mapping of Pfkelch13 gene polymorphism in Africa in the era of emerging Plasmodium falciparum resistance to artemisinin: a systematic review.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S1473-3099(20)30493-X
A1  - Kayiba, Nadine K
