T1  - A comprehensive analysis of drug resistance molecular markers and Plasmodium falciparum genetic diversity in two malaria endemic sites in Mali.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12936-019-2986-5
A1  - Diakite, Seidina A S
A1  - Traore, Karim
A1  - Sanogo, Ibrahim
A1  - Clark, Taane G
