T1  - pfk13-Independent Treatment Failure in Four Imported Cases of Plasmodium falciparum Malaria Treated with Artemether-Lumefantrine in the United Kingdom.
T3  - Comment in: Antimicrob Agents Chemother. 2017 May 24;61(6):e00498-17. doi: 10.1128/AAC.00498-17. PMID: 28539500 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28539500] Comment in: Antimicrob Agents Chemother. 2017 May 24;61(6):e00529-17. doi: 10.1128/AAC.00529-17. PMID: 28539501 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28539501] Comment in: Antimicrob Agents Chemother. 2017 Jun 27;61(7):e00721-17. doi: 10.1128/AAC.00721-17. PMID: 28655744 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28655744] Comment in: Antimicrob Agents Chemother. 2017 Jun 27;61(7):e00815-17. doi: 10.1128/AAC.00815-17. PMID: 28655745 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28655745]
