T1  - Persistence of Plasmodium falciparum parasitemia after artemisinin combination therapy: evidence from a randomized trial in Uganda.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/srep26330
A1  - Chang, Hsiao-Han
A1  - Meibalan, Elamaran
A1  - Zelin, Justin
A1  - Daniels, Rachel
