T1  - Population Structure Shapes Copy Number Variation in Malaria Parasites.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msv282
A1  - Cheeseman, Ian H
A1  - Miller, Becky
A1  - Tan, John C
A1  - Tan, Asako
A1  - Nair, Shalini
A1  - Nkhoma, Standwell C
A1  - De Donato, Marcos
A1  - Rodulfo, Hectorina
A1  - Dondorp, Arjen
