T1  - A novel locus of resistance to severe malaria in a region of ancient balancing selection.
T3  - Comment in: Trends Parasitol. 2016 Jan;32(1):5-7. doi: 10.1016/j.pt.2015.11.006. PMID: 26613665 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26613665]
