T1  - Malaria continues to select for sickle cell trait in Central Africa.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1505665112
A1  - Elguero, Eric
A1  - Delicat-Loembet, Lucrece M
A1  - Rougeron, Virginie
A1  - Arnathau, Celine
