T1  - Polymorphisms in the K13-propeller gene in artemisinin-susceptible Plasmodium falciparum parasites from Bougoula-Hameau and Bandiagara, Mali.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.4269/ajtmh.14-0605
A1  - Ouattara, Amed
A1  - Kone, Aminatou
A1  - Adams, Matthew
A1  - Fofana, Bakary
A1  - Maiga, Amelia Walling
