T1  - Analysis of major genome loci underlying artemisinin resistance and pfmdr1 copy number in pre- and post-ACTs in western Kenya.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/srep08308
A1  - Ngalah, Bidii S
A1  - Ingasia, Luiser A
A1  - Cheruiyot, Agnes C
