T1  - Alternatively spliced transcripts and novel pseudogenes of the Plasmodium falciparum resistance-associated locus pfcrt detected in East African malaria patients.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/jac/dku358
A1  - Gadalla, Nahla B
A1  - Malmberg, Maja
A1  - Adam, Ishag
A1  - Oguike, Mary C
