T1  - Limited polymorphisms in k13 gene in Plasmodium falciparum isolates from Dakar, Senegal in 2012-2013.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/1475-2875-13-472
A1  - Torrentino-Madamet, Marylin
