T1  - Absence of the human CYP2C8*3 allele in Ugandan children exposed to Plasmodium falciparum malaria.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.meegid.2014.08.011
A1  - Paganotti, Giacomo Maria
A1  - Cosentino, Valentina
A1  - Russo, Gianluca
