T1  - Seasonal Malaria Chemoprevention with Sulphadoxine-Pyrimethamine and Amodiaquine Selects Pfdhfr-dhps Quintuple Mutant Genotype in Mali.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0162718
A1  - Maiga, Hamma
A1  - Lasry, Estrella
A1  - Diarra, Modibo
A1  - Sagara, Issaka
